# CHANNEL — ONE ANNOUNCEMENT (OWNER LOCK 2026-08-17 · FOREVER)

**Bobby, verbatim:** when the owner tells you to write an announcement in Channel, **always clear the previous message**. We cannot have two or more messages at the same time in Channel.

Earned 2026-08-17: idle-gt5 fairness line was published while the creator-film line stayed live. Earn-hub then returned **two** admin lines. Home Channel is one strip. Two announcements = two stories. Fail.

## The rule

When Bobby says put / write / publish a **Channel** announcement (Comms line, Important line, Home Channel):

1. **List live lines first** (`GET /api/admin/channel-lines`). Every `active` + not-expired row in that market.
2. **Pause (deactivate) every other live line** before the new POST. Do not delete — pause so it can come back later if he asks. Market-scope: Kenya `KE` unless he named another market.
3. **Then** publish the new line (≤140 chars, highlight inside the text, brand-safe, expiry required).
4. **Prove** from the phone payload: `GET /api/home/earn-hub` `channelLines` length is **1**, and that one text is the new announcement.

## Forbidden

- Stacking a new line next to film / Learn / old fairness / anything else
- Treating backend `MAX_PUBLIC_LINES = 2` as permission to run two announcements
- Closing out with “it’s first of two” as if that is OK
- Leaving a previous line active “so it can expire on its own”

## Proof

Closeout must say: **paused N previous live lines** · **earn-hub channelLines = 1** · quote the one text.

